window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>All it took was one friendly barbecue to change everything....</b><br> <br> Because when I showed up, I met him.<br> <br> Rocco.<br> <br> He says I'm his mate, which is basically a werewolf's instant wife.<br> <br> Honestly, I'm not all that opposed to the idea.<br> <br> Mostly because my instant-hubby comes with a house, and I'm a day away from being homeless.<br> <br> I don't expect the family-like wolf pack that comes with said mate, though, or the mysterious dude who <i>isn't</i> Rocco who is also apparently living in the house I inherited when he decided I was his and then got stuck in his furry form.<br> <br> I'm not sure what my future holds, but one thing's becoming crystal clear:<br> <br> Rocco will be a part of it, one way or another.<br> <br> <i>This stand-alone new-adult paranormal romance features sarcasm, humor, and a slow-burn love story. Recommended for listeners 17+.</i></p>"; 
